#. Description of the plugin
#: baukasten-business-cards.php
msgid "Digital business cards as a custom post type, served on their own short URL and detached from the active theme."
msgstr "Digitale Visitenkarten als eigener Inhaltstyp, ausgeliefert unter einer eigenen kurzen URL und vom aktiven Theme abgekoppelt."

#. Author of the plugin
#: baukasten-business-cards.php
msgid "Torsten B."
